@url = http://localhost:3000

### GET rectangulos
GET {{url}}/rectangulos

### GET rectangulo id
GET {{url}}/rectangulos/3


### add rectangulo
POST {{url}}/rectangulos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "base": 5,
    "altura": 15
}

### modificar rectangulo
PUT {{url}}/rectangulos/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "base": 5,
    "altura": 20
}

### eliminar rectangulo 
DELETE {{url}}/rectangulos/2